[{"title":"内直遇雪","author":"何景明","text":"袅袅城云影，萧萧急霰催。\n远从仙阁度，轻绕凤池回。\n弄日摇彤管，含风引玉杯。\n春还今岁早，先报汉宫梅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":624,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入朝遇雨","author":"何景明","text":"跃马天街霁，趋朝冷色催。\n好风先北起，微雨自东来。\n柳拂重城锁，花笼复道回。\n万方忧旱日，沾洒望蓬莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":625,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将雪有怀","author":"何景明","text":"长安十万户，骑马欲何之。\n已动寻梅兴，空成采葛诗。\n雪心知霰集，云意怯风吹。\n今夜西堂烛，萧然有所思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":626,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬月","author":"何景明","text":"冬月少光辉，霜天影渐微。\n鼓鼙仍雪塞，灯火自风扉。\n水冻蛟潜泣，沙寒雁不飞。\n何时汉家将，双照羽旗归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":627,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋雨","author":"何景明","text":"断续城头雨，空斋绿藓封。\n孤灯闻过雁，四璧起鸣蛩。\n细草伤心碧，幽花满目浓。\n美人居绮陌，几日不相逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":628,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十七夜月思","author":"何景明","text":"秋夜已如此，美人安在兹。\n含颦向王魄，扬耒忆蛾眉。\n袅袅芳香歇，盈盈白露滋。\n河关怅伊阻，谁复讯佳期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":629,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨雪曲","author":"何景明","text":"蒲海云成阵，天山雪作花。\n长城烽火入，虏骑动鸣笳。\n雾深迷汉月，风起暗胡沙。\n一夜关河冷，征人尽念家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":630,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"星变","author":"何景明","text":"星变干常纪，花开与令违。\n九重方避殿，四海望垂衣。\n赋敛何时缓，流亡几处归。\n庙堂图至理，早晚答天威。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":631,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬月","author":"何景明","text":"冬月今宵满，他乡此夜情。\n城高初影堞，楼静故当楹。\n雾濯寒辉苦，风吹夕晕生。\n捲帘愁不寐，庭树宿鸦惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":632,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月食","author":"何景明","text":"月蚀中秋夜，中天万国看。\n衣冠连大内，钟鼓动长安。\n光没天河晓，阴沉渤海寒。\n圣心应念此，长望五云端。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":633,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九月十五夜月","author":"何景明","text":"万里高秋月，青天此夜看。\n乍流关塞影，遥出海云端。\n淅淅开风幔，辉辉傍菊栏。\n清笳奏城阙，为报汉宫寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":634,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋无月","author":"何景明","text":"月赏今年罢，高楼独客愁。\n关山中夜笛，江汉故乡舟。\n暗雨捎檐入，秋萤度槛流。\n应知云雾上，天柱有人游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":635,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六月望月食","author":"何景明","text":"未月黄衢厄，妖遮赤道行。\n魄残疑近晦，食甚始生明。\n奏鼓风飙惨，登坛雷雨清。\n搀抢犹未扫，天意岂休兵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":636,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元日","author":"何景明","text":"元日王正月，传乎晚殿班。\n千官齐鹄立，万国候龙颜。\n辨色旌旗入，冲星剑佩还。\n圣躬无乃倦，几欲问当关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":637,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五更","author":"何景明","text":"五更霜雪霁，忽梦紫宸班。\n天上传钟鼓，风前想佩环。\n鸡鸣无复咏，马动亦虚还。\n忆在先朝日，朝朝见圣颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":638,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三月三日","author":"何景明","text":"病眼看天地，风沙当昼吹。\n赏心孤酒伴，行乐过花时。\n水曲兰芳静，城阴柳絮迟。\n东郊有车马，春色报人知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":639,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕","author":"何景明","text":"灯火万家欢，高楼玉漏残。\n舞留华月缓，歌袅绿云繁。\n雪郭春初霁，烟城夜不寒。\n尽桥垂柳外，游女佩珊珊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":640,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十月一日二首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"今日孟冬朔，轻烟澹晓暾。\n北风飘一雁，寒气入千门。\n消息断行客，关河迷故园。\n浮生元不定，俯仰任乾坤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":641,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十月一日二首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"严霜凄卉木，兹岁忽将周。\n寂寂龙蛇蛰，寥寥江海流。\n暮灯喧巷哭，风角起边愁。\n不尽中原望，难寻万里楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":642,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁晏","author":"何景明","text":"岁晏看人事，苍茫系所思。\n浮云当日暮，积雪见春迟。\n报国元无术，宁亲未有期。\n独怜张内侍，吟绝四愁诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":643,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋","author":"何景明","text":"风尘悲海内，满月对长安。\n闻道王侯第，中宵晏未阑。\n遏云催玉管，生水弄金盘。\n独念南征将，关山此夜寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":644,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三月三日","author":"何景明","text":"三月正三日，长安春可哀。\n雁从南国至，花向北人开。\n戎马中原地，乡关万里台。\n蹉跎叹物色，容易岁年催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":645,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明日病怀","author":"何景明","text":"旅舍清明日，长安新火烟。\n桃花转愁思，竹叶兴萧然。\n客病闲官马，囊空涩俸钱。\n故乡闻稍定，南望好林泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":646,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢崔太史惠菊","author":"何景明","text":"遗我高庭菊，怀君秋树林。\n香添竹叶盏，色助草堂吟。\n翠盖翻风槛，霜天倚玉簪。\n晚芳如不歇，可比岁寒心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":647,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观荷","author":"何景明","text":"入院高荷密，留尊菡萏迟。\n绛房扶水萼，翠盖倚风枝。\n槛坐明星夕，窗过骤雨时。\n流萤点点度，故傍绿阴池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":648,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寺中吾子馆海石榴","author":"何景明","text":"西林云昼静，覆院海榴花。\n坐映东窗下，疑窥邻女家。\n枝枝摇绿水，片片落丹霞。\n错比珊瑚树，光辉逼日华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":649,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汝庆宅红菊二首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"秋花何太艳，绿盏慰飘零。\n笑比西施醉，愁怜楚客醒。\n云高开烂熳，烟细袅娉婷。\n好为多沽酒，频来倒玉瓶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":650,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沈道士馆牡丹","author":"何景明","text":"仙亭牡丹树，不数玉山桃。\n忽漫相逢处，开花烂熳高。\n彩云停度曲，迟日动挥毫。\n明岁天坛路，春风忆锦袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":651,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中红芍药","author":"何景明","text":"百花堪独立，一雨更风流。\n日暮行云女，仙裳覆楚丘。\n明添丹脸激，暗抱锦心愁。\n晴昼犹须赏，何人驻紫骝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":652,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芍药","author":"何景明","text":"城中芍药遍，席上把残枝。\n上苑相看日，春风尔较迟。\n艳歌翻锦瑟，酣醉倒金卮。\n南国今开罢，园亭数梦思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":653,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观竹","author":"何景明","text":"相国西垣第，新看种竹成。\n叶香鸣凤宿，根古蛰龙生。\n雨洗琅玕色，风传竽籁声。\n山林轻肉食，心迹喜双清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":654,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鲁山院竹","author":"何景明","text":"泰公堂下竹，覆地长新篁。\n雨飐春墙碧，风含石室凉。\n经行留下榻，晏坐对焚香。\n遗响流笙凤，时时落上方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":655,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹦鹉","author":"何景明","text":"不恨金笼闭，其如铁锁牢。\n侧身燕雪苦，垂趐陇云高。\n岂为能言语，番令妒羽毛。\n角鹰何猛气，翻掣锦鞲绦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":656,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春雁","author":"何景明","text":"花初背楚泽，雪罢度桑乾。\n渐起随春色，高飞犯朔寒。\n书停江国望，阵倚塞门看。\n忆尔常南北，无嗟行路难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":657,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雁","author":"何景明","text":"呖呖胡笳怨，飘飘南雁翔。\n长风度关塞，九月下潇湘。\n积水浮连影，遥空起断行。\n故园秋望尽，闻尔泪沾裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":658,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻雁","author":"何景明","text":"鸣雁南方去，人今北地闻。\n水寒沉塞角，沙暮起秋云。\n独叫如求侣，相呼恐失群。\n高楼潜望尔，乡思转纷纷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":659,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"獐","author":"何景明","text":"碧山谁放汝，华馆故相羁。\n野性看人骇，闲身顾影疑。\n草香春过处，花暖昼眠时。\n无限云林李，樊笼祗自悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":660,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"彼美东邻子","author":"何景明","text":"彼美东邻子，花间白日醺。\n纤腰人不见，妙曲转愁闻。\n舞罢空明月，歌馀尚彩云。\n章台杨柳树，花暮落纷纷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":661,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪夜九梅翁园同苍谷宴集二首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"郏城风雪夜，骑马叩谁门。\n乘兴宁回棹，宽愁数倒尊。\n茆堂开洞壑，枫岸叠沙村。\n朝市山林意，非翁未易论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":662,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪夜九梅翁园同苍谷宴集二首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"冬夜南园集，携游兴未穷。\n登台望积雪，下岭逐回风。\n骏爱林中马，冥思海上鸿。\n不因苍谷子，谁识九梅翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":663,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"到鄠简王敬夫","author":"何景明","text":"杜曲花无数，城南柳更重。\n去天惟尺五，隔岁一相逢。\n雨过春陂水，云开紫阁峰。\n好陪王学士，杯酒日从容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":664,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同敬夫游至华阳谷闻歌妙曲","author":"何景明","text":"名邑今重过，终南第一游。\n山中白雪倡，天上綵云流。\n柳散秦川色，花含杜曲愁。\n同时霄汉侣，十载卧林丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":665,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过康子德涵彭麓别业","author":"何景明","text":"不求金马召，翻爱碧山栖。\n柳色闲门闭，桃花曲径迷。\n酒船时问字，翠璧有留题。\n只此林泉好，无烦到浒西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":666,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答张道夫都阃病怀","author":"何景明","text":"不到将军第，秋清病起迟。\n谁知平子后，复有四愁诗。\n月幌临书帖，风庭掩戟枝。\n东桥好山水，何日赴幽期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":667,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日同陈侍御凤谷登宴","author":"何景明","text":"柏台骢马使，兰谷凤仙家。\n暂驻三秦节，来看九日花。\n风霜高锦树，云日丽清沙。\n去去层霄上，回瞻北斗斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":668,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送閒云子还河内","author":"何景明","text":"尔西访崆峒，东随河上公。\n神仙自有友，不与世人同。\n王屋留鸡犬，天坛蹑斗虹。\n白云从此驾，去去入无穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":669,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧病简汝济士奇时济二首 其一","author":"何景明","text":"卧病常迟起，焚香独燕居。\n聊因谢簿领，暂得弄琴书。\n岳色盈虚牖，泉流绕暗渠。\n虽然官府内，不异在林庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":670,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧病简汝济士奇时济二首 其二","author":"何景明","text":"习隐开三径，耽幽构一斋。\n吏人稀到户，鸟雀自驯阶。\n药补身差健，诗成闷强排。\n同声二二子，不见好音来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":671,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过马溪田村居","author":"何景明","text":"宛宛清河曲，团团翠竹村。\n卧龙元胜地，容驷已高门。\n野旷嵯峨出，天寒云雾屯。\n何时还过访，无限欲相论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":672,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬夜过仲木","author":"何景明","text":"汉殿词臣第，秦川处士家。\n过逢遥慰藉，文翰转光华。\n夜兴山阴雪，春情渭北花。\n江湖望霄汉，相对一长嗟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":673,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄彭幸庵中丞","author":"何景明","text":"山海藏身远，朝廷属望频。\n骏功收战伐，龙卧偃经纶。\n星宿黄河气，风云华岳神。\n生才元有待，终起慰斯人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":674,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠张时济陈伯行胡承之周少安三月三日出城游宴","author":"何景明","text":"芳筵开上日，才子出京华。\n暂别含香署，俱停访石槎。\n秦川平对酒，汉苑曲穿花。\n应共题春草，相过谢客家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":675,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张行人赍大行皇帝遗诏使秦蜀","author":"何景明","text":"我皇忽晏驾，君行辞直庐。\n九霄持使节，万里捧哀书。\n湖望双龙鼎，桥回驷马车。\n锦城花满树，争识汉相如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":676,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明日病卧闻三司诸公出城","author":"何景明","text":"伏枕花辰过，闭门樽酒空。\n宾朋临水上，供帐出城中。\n柳色龙池雨，莺歌柘苑风。\n秦川多胜事，游赏未能同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":677,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秦府进历","author":"何景明","text":"宝历颁天阙，金樽宴锦轩。\n万年周正朔，七叶汉宗藩。\n向日蓂阶晓，含风蕙砌暄。\n同欢承睿款，歌舞颂乾元。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":678,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拜将坛","author":"何景明","text":"汉主西封日，淮阴拜将时。\n坛场如往日，朝代几迁移。\n王气风云歇，雄图日月垂。\n江山吊故国，谁复见旌旗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":679,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秦岭谒韩祠","author":"何景明","text":"门萝登峻岭，级石上荒祠。\n雪阻南迁路，云停北望时。\n文衰真有作，道丧已前知。\n千载经行地，高山空尔思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":680,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登五丈原谒武侯庙","author":"何景明","text":"风日高原暮，松杉古庙阴。\n三分扶汉业，万里出师心。\n星落营空在，云横阵已沉。\n千秋一瞻眺，梁甫为谁吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":681,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"普缘寺有马融读书洞","author":"何景明","text":"春山寻古寺，昏黑尚攀缘。\n仄径千盘转，巉崖万仞悬。\n虎常啼白昼，猿忽堕青天。\n欲访名贤洞，泠泠隔涧泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":682,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书院课士雨至有作","author":"何景明","text":"两色閒堂静，横经坐昼深。\n笙歌非绛帐，弦诵有青衿。\n竹劲捎檐碧，松寒覆院阴。\n万人忧旱日，洗耳听秋霖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":683,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登楼凤县作","author":"何景明","text":"近讯中原使，兼登万里楼。\n朝廷仍北极，行在且南州。\n峡断风云隔，江通日月流。\n如闻乘八骏，早晚向昆丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":684,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东河三月晦日","author":"何景明","text":"雨宿东河夜，送春山馆寒。\n远沙霾雾树，危石上风湍。\n惯涉波涛险，偏经道路难。\n平生四方志，回首欲求安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":685,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青峰阁晓霁","author":"何景明","text":"初日东峰上，微微霁色分。\n丹崖含宿雨，青嶂拂归云。\n候骑林端发，鸣笳树里闻。\n前山更可爱，晴望碧氛氲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":686,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草店雨行","author":"何景明","text":"山馆夏阴澹，雨行寒色凄。\n奔湍回白石，折坂下青泥。\n栈道常通北，江流却向西。\n千峰问来路，烟雾使人迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":687,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"马道骤雷雨复霁","author":"何景明","text":"万壑惊雷起，千峰鸣雨过。\n稍看风濑减，更觉夏云多。\n虹饮垂青涧，猿行挂碧萝。\n山中无吏事，长啸荅樵歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":688,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弘道书院","author":"何景明","text":"梁栋起层云，松筠散夕曛。\n九嵏瞻泰岱，清渭接河汾。\n冠盖时时集，弦歌夜夜闻。\n登堂持节印，衰薄愧斯文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":689,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咸阳原","author":"何景明","text":"千秋陵墓地，驻马惜兹行。\n晚日登原殿，晴天见渭城。\n望春时极目，访古独含情。\n柰有咸阳草，风吹岁岁生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":690,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂寺","author":"何景明","text":"昔读高僧传，今看胜地形。\n院寒留桧柏，殿古落丹青。\n宝塔参遗影，荒台问译经。\n驻车春日暮，散步出林坰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":691,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"说经台","author":"何景明","text":"西海何年去，南山万古存。\n风云留福地，星斗上天门。\n有欲谁观妙，无为自觉尊。\n青牛不复返，空诵五千言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":692,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"普缘塔","author":"何景明","text":"石盖凌空起，丹梯出翠微。\n云从珠顶覆，灯转镜中辉。\n雁沼波涛涌，龙宫日月围。\n何能攀绝顶，一览汉邦畿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":693,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"磻溪","author":"何景明","text":"丈人昔未遇，垂钓此溪中。\n不感风云会，谁知八十翁。\n晚枫渔浦暗，春草猎原空。\n独今千载下，怀古意无穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":694,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]